FLD1161  DFLD  POS=(11,61),LTH=0006,ATTR=(NUM,PROT)                             
         DFLD  'Stil mall (web)   ',                                   *        
               POS=(12,02),LTH=0018,ATTR=(NUM,PROT)                             
FLD1221  DFLD  POS=(12,21),LTH=0008,ATTR=(ALPHA)                                
